  "_meta": {
    "note": "Summary tab ranking (BEHAVIOR-MOBILE section 6, CCRM-98 (Summary Tab), wireframe design/2026-11-02-summary-tab.html rev B). Spec-first, written 2026-11-02 by script from the rule, not ported from code. Each account gives its Weekly reading (usedPct null = no reading), core section 6's elapsedPct, the weekly msUntilReset, and its 5h: sessionPct, sessionMsUntilReset (null = no clock) and sessionBinding, core section 6.2's predicate already evaluated (a client computes it; these cases test the ranking). expected lists names in display order with each one's group. paceForReference is core section 6.1's pace rounded to 0.01, for reading the order by eye.",
    "rule": "eligible = a reading, usedPct < 99.5, not sessionBinding; by pace ascending, a tie to the smaller msUntilReset. Then held (sessionBinding, week not spent) by sessionMsUntilReset ascending; then spent (usedPct >= 99.5) by msUntilReset ascending; then no reading, in tab order. A spent week is never held."
  },
